# PROJECT AETHER — Build a Premium Interactive Audio Visualizer Website

You are an elite creative developer, senior frontend engineer, interactive experience designer, audio visualization specialist, and motion designer.

Your task is to DESIGN AND BUILD a complete, functional, visually stunning, production-quality audio visualization website called **AETHER**.

Do not merely describe the website, provide a plan, or generate a static mockup. Build the actual working application with functional interactions, real-time audio analysis, responsive layouts, and polished animations.

Make creative decisions independently. Do not ask me to choose every design detail. Aim for a result that feels like a premium product designed by a team at Apple, Teenage Engineering, Nothing, and a cutting-edge interactive digital studio.

The website should feel immersive, futuristic, smooth, atmospheric, and addictive to explore without becoming cluttered.

